 # API

-JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.
+JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md` (including `GET /audit` for the audit log).
+
+## Authentication and roles
+
+Requests carry `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys live in `apiKeys` as `{ key, name, role }`:
+
+- `viewer`: may only read (`GET`, except `GET /audit`).
+- `cook`: may read and also cook recipes (`POST /recipes/:id/cook`), record waste (`POST /batches/:id/waste`), log temperatures (`POST /temperatures`) and enter stock-take counts (`POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`).
+- `manager`: may do everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+Missing or unknown keys answer 401 (`unauthorized`); keys without permission answer 403 (`forbidden`).

 ## Errors

